~ start
Innkeeper: Rest here for five gold. You will heal, restore your resources, and bind your return point.
- Open inn services.
	do InnService.open_from_dialogue()
	Innkeeper: Use the inn window to rest or receive healing.
	=> END
- Just a healer's touch, no bind.
	do InnService.request_heal()
	Innkeeper: Then stand still.
	=> END
- Not now.
	Innkeeper: The hearth stays lit.
	=> END
